Run it. Line B knows your favourite colour, and line C — the identical
question, to the identical model, seconds later — does not, and says so.
Nothing was forgotten between B and C, because nothing was ever re-
membered. The model is stateless : it retains nothing between requests,
and every request is answered from scratch using only what that request
contains. The illusion of memory in any chat product you have used is
a program on the other side doing just what ask does: keeping an array
and resending it.

